---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Heading from "../components/Heading.astro";
import TrustBar from "../components/TrustBar.astro";
import ServiceGrid from "../components/ServiceGrid.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { heroImages } from "../data/images";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Freeway Mobile Tyres is one the UK's first mobile tyre fitting services. Freeway Mobile Tyres is based in Poole and has been in the tyre trade for over 30 years.">
  <Heading
    text="A family business bringing the tyre shop to your door"
    eyebrow="About us"
    intro="Based in Poole, Freeway Mobile Tyres has been in the tyre trade for over 30 years."
  />
  <TrustBar />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-split">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
      At Freeway Mobile Tyres, we understand that your time is valuable, and
      that's why we're dedicated to providing a mobile tyre-fitting service
      that's as convenient and flexible as possible. Our mission is to make your
      life easier and save you time by bringing our services directly to your
      doorstep, at a time that suits you.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our team of friendly technicians are available to help you 24 hours a day,
      7 days a week, 365 days a year. We're always here for you in the event of
      a tyre emergency, whether you're at home, at work, or on the roadside.
    </p>
    <p>
      With Freeway Mobile Tyres, you don't need to worry about travelling to a
      garage or waiting in a crowded waiting room. All you need to do is give us
      a call, and we'll take care of the rest. Our technicians will come to you
      and fit your new tyres while you put your feet up, so you can relax and
      enjoy your day.
    </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-figure">
        <Image
          src={heroImages["about-us"]}
          alt="Aerial view of the Freeway Mobile Tyres depot in Poole, with the team and fleet of vans"
          widths={[480, 720, 960]}
          sizes="(min-width: 992px) 520px, 100vw"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface">
    <div class="container about-cards">
      <div class="about-card prose">
        <h2>Our Values</h2>
        <p>
      At Freeway Mobile Tyres, we're proud to be a small family-owned and
      operated business. We take great pride in providing the best quality tyre
      service to our customers, and we always go above and beyond to ensure your
      complete satisfaction.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe that everyone deserves high-quality service, which is why we
      offer same-day fitting at no extra cost, and cover most of the Dorset
      area. Our commitment to providing the best service possible is reflected
      in the quality of our work and the loyalty of our customers.
    </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card prose">
        <h2>Our Future</h2>
        <p>
      At Freeway Mobile Tyres, we're always looking to expand our services and
      provide our mobile tyre service to all Dorset residents. That's why we
      currently have eight mobile tyre-fitting vans on the road, each equipped
      with the latest technology and tools to ensure your safety and
      satisfaction.
    </p>
    <p>
      In addition, we've recently opened our new depot in Shaftesbury, which
      enables us to better serve customers in that area. We're constantly
      investing in new technology and expanding our reach, so that we can
      continue to provide the best possible service to our customers throughout
      the region.
    </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-history">
      <div class="about-year" aria-hidden="true">
        <div>
          <span>Est.</span>
          <strong>1990</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our History</h2>
        <p>
      While Freeway Mobile Tyres was only established in the last few years, our
      team has been in the tyre trade for over 30 years. Our founder, Paul
      Spicer, started Mobile Tyres in August 1990, one of the UK's first mobile
      car tyre fitting companies. Paul's idea was simple – to save customers
      time and energy by bringing the tyre shop to their front door.
    </p>
    <p>
      Over the years, we've helped countless stay-at-home parents, stranded
      drivers, and business people, all of whom love the convenience that mobile
      tyre-fitting brings. Finally, they could have their tyres changed without
      having to spend hours in a garage. They could work, study, tidy up, play
      with the kids, or watch TV instead.
    </p>
    <p>
      With the growth of the mobile tyre-fitting scene over the last decade,
      Freeway Mobile Tyres has become the preferred choice for people in Dorset
      who need to change their tyres. We're proud to continue our legacy of
      excellent service and innovative solutions, even as we look towards the
      future.
    </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ServiceGrid heading="What we can do for you" />
  <div class="section-spacer"></div>
  <CtaBand quoteHref="/#quoteForm" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-split {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-7);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .about-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }
  }

  .about-figure {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-figure::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--space-5) calc(var(--space-5) * -1) calc(var(--space-5) * -1) var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--color-red-500);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .about-figure :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .about-cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-history {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 980px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .about-history {
      grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }
  }

  .about-year {
    align-self: start;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    max-width: 220px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 10px var(--color-ink-800), inset 0 0 0 12px var(--color-red-500);
  }

  .about-year span {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-400);
  }

  .about-year strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 859px) {
    .about-year {
      width: 160px;
    }

    .about-year strong {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .section-spacer {
    height: var(--section-y);
  }
</style>
